# Composer dependencies - never served over HTTP.
#
# Third-party packages routinely ship examples, test fixtures and scripts that
# were never meant to be reachable, so the whole tree is closed rather than
# picked over file by file.
#
# This duplicates the rewrite rule in the repository-root .htaccess on purpose.
# That rule needs mod_rewrite; this one does not.
#
# Tracked in git via the "!vendor/.htaccess" exception in .gitignore, so a
# fresh clone is protected before anyone runs `composer install`.
Require all denied
